---
source: crates/litigate-sema/tests/kinds.rs
expression: what
---
[
    "declare: cannot declare; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, general-order, standing-order, case-order, emergency-declaration, guidance, binding precedent, persuasive precedent, overruling",
    "prescribe: cannot prescribe a time limit or how time is counted; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, general-order, standing-order, case-order",
    "rank: cannot order authority levels; permitted to base",
    "version: cannot replace another package's declaration in time; permitted to base, amendment",
    "override: cannot displace another package's declaration; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, general-order, standing-order, case-order",
    "interpret: cannot defeat another package's default; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, standing-order, case-order, binding precedent",
    "recharacterize: cannot recharacterize another package's deadline; permitted to base, amendment, binding precedent",
    "invalidate: cannot invalidate another instrument's claims; permitted to base, amendment, binding precedent, overruling",
    "waive: cannot waive another package's requirement; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, general-order, standing-order, case-order, binding precedent",
    "grant-cap: cannot give a capability; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, standing-order, emergency-declaration",
    "set-prior: cannot set the prior of a draw; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, standing-order, case-order, guidance, binding precedent, persuasive precedent",
    "add-fact: cannot state a matter fact; permitted to base, amendment, local-rule, standing-order, case-order",
]
